{"concept_key": "VG:CONCEPT:RAJATA-SILVER", "label_en": "silver", "label_sa": "rajata", "kind": "MATERIAL", "sub_kind": "SUBSTANCE", "node_status": "PROPOSED_NEW", "samhita_attested": true, "samhita_attestation_by_veda": {"AV": 4, "RV": 1, "YV": 2}, "samhita_attestation_examples": {"AV": ["VG:AV:SAU:K05:S028:V001", "VG:AV:SAU:K08:S010:V023", "VG:AV:SAU:K08:S010:V028", "VG:AV:SAU:K13:S004:V051"], "RV": ["VG:RV:SAK:M08:S025:V022"], "YV": ["VG:YV:VSM:A23:V037", "VG:YV:VSM:A29:V059"]}, "supplementary_attestation_count": 21, "supplementary_attestation_by_work": {"SBM": 3, "KatySS": 4, "GB": 2, "KausS": 1, "PB": 3, "LatSS": 2, "AB": 2, "KausB": 1, "AsvSS": 2, "SankhSS": 1}, "evidence": [{"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:KatySS:10:2:37", "citation": "KatySS 10.2.37", "evidence_source_type": "SRAUTASUTRA", "quote": "na rajataṃ dadyād barhiṣi purāsya saṃvatsarād gṛhe rudantīti śruteḥ", "translation": null}, {"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:SBM:3:4:4:3:2", "citation": "SBM 3.4.4.3.2", "evidence_source_type": "BRAHMANA", "quote": "tato 'surā eṣu lokeṣu puraś cakrire 'yasmayīm evāsmiṃl loke rajatām antarikṣe hariṇīṃ divi", "translation": null}, {"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:PB:6:6:8", "citation": "PB 6.6.8", "evidence_source_type": "BRAHMANA", "quote": "svarbhānur vā āsura ādityaṃ tamasāvidhyat taṃ devā na vyajānaṃs te 'trim upādhāvaṃs tasyātrir bhāsena tamo 'pāhan yat prathamam apāhan sā kṛṣṇāvir abhavad yad dvitīyaṃ sā rajatā yat tṛtīyaṃ sā lohinī yayā varṇam abhyatṛṇat sā śuklāsīt", "translation": "The daemoniac Svarbhānu struck the sun with darkness; the Gods did not discern it (the sun, hidden as it was by darkness); they resorted to Atri; Atri repelled its darkness by the bhasa. The part of the darkness he first repelled became a black sheep, what (he repelled) the second time (became) a silvery (sheep), what (he repelled) the third time (became) a reddish one, and with what (arrow) he set free its original appearance (colour), that was a white sheep."}], "existence_evidence_type": "SAMHITA"}
