{"concept_key": "VG:CONCEPT:SYAMA-DARK-METAL", "label_en": "dark metal", "label_sa": "śyāma", "kind": "MATERIAL", "sub_kind": "SUBSTANCE", "node_status": "PROPOSED_NEW", "samhita_attested": true, "samhita_attestation_by_veda": {"AV": 2, "RV": 1, "YV": 3}, "samhita_attestation_examples": {"AV": ["VG:AV:SAU:K08:S001:V009", "VG:AV:SAU:K11:S003:V007"], "RV": ["VG:RV:SAK:M06:S005:V007"], "YV": ["VG:YV:VSM:A18:V013", "VG:YV:VSM:A18:V074", "VG:YV:VSM:A29:V058"]}, "supplementary_attestation_count": 9, "supplementary_attestation_by_work": {"KatySS": 3, "ParGS": 1, "KausS": 1, "KausB": 2, "AsvSS": 1, "KausGS": 1}, "evidence": [{"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:KatySS:14:2:13", "citation": "KatySS 14.2.13", "evidence_source_type": "SRAUTASUTRA", "quote": "prājāpatyāṃś ca saptadaśa śyāmatūparān bastān", "translation": null}, {"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:KausB:2:9:9", "citation": "KausB 2.9.9", "evidence_source_type": "BRAHMANA", "quote": "śyāmaśabalau hāsyāgnihotraṃ vikhidataḥ", "translation": null}, {"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:ParGS:1:16:24", "citation": "ParGS 1.16.24", "evidence_source_type": "GRHYASUTRA", "quote": "yadi kumāra upadravejjālena pracchādyottarīyeṇa vā pitāṅka ādhāya japati kūrkuraḥ sukūrkuraḥ kūrkuro bālabandhanaḥ / ceccecchunaka sṛja namaste astu sīsaro lapetāpahvara tat satyam / yat te devā varam adaduḥ sa tvaṃ kumārameva vā vṛṇīthāḥ /", "translation": "[*24]. If (the demon bringing disease) Kumara attacks the boy, the father covers him with a net or with an upper garment, takes him on his lap, and murmurs: Kurkura, Sukurkura, Kurkura, who holds fast children. Ket! ket! doggy! let him loose. Reverence be to thee, the Sisara, barker, bender. 'That is true that the gods have given a boon to thee. Hast thou then chosen even this boy? 'Ket! ket! doggy! let him loose. Reverence be to thee, the Sisara, barker, bender. 'That is true that (the divine she-dog) Sarama is thy mother, Sisara thy father, the black and the speckled (two dogs of Yama) thy brothers. 'Ket! ket! doggy! let him loose. Reverence be to thee, the Sisara, barker, bender.'"}], "existence_evidence_type": "SAMHITA"}
{"concept_key": "VG:CONCEPT:LAVANA-SALT", "label_en": "salt", "label_sa": "lavaṇa", "kind": "MATERIAL", "sub_kind": "SUBSTANCE", "node_status": "PROPOSED_NEW", "samhita_attested": false, "samhita_attestation_by_veda": {}, "samhita_attestation_examples": {}, "supplementary_attestation_count": 7, "supplementary_attestation_by_work": {"GB": 2, "KausS": 3, "SVidhB": 1, "LatSS": 1}, "evidence": [{"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:KausS:3:2:1", "citation": "KausS 3.2.1", "evidence_source_type": "GRHYASUTRA", "quote": "ambayo yanti śaṃbhumayobhubhyāṃ brahma jajñānam ā gāvo ekā ca me iti gā lavaṇaṃ pāyayaty upatāpinīḥ", "translation": null}, {"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:GB:1:1:14:8", "citation": "GB 1.1.14.8", "evidence_source_type": "BRAHMANA", "quote": "tad yathā lavaṇena suvarṇaṃ saṃdadhyāt suvarṇena rajataṃ rajatena lohaṃ lohena sīsaṃ sīsena trapv evam evāsya yajñasya viriṣṭaṃ saṃdhīyate", "translation": null}, {"supplementary_key": "VG:SUPP:SVidhB:1:5:15", "citation": "SVidhB 1.5.15", "evidence_source_type": "BRAHMANA", "quote": "surāṃ pītvā saṃvatsaram aṣṭame kāle bhuñjāno yat pāṇyoḥ sambhaved avāṅnābhy ūrdhvaṃjānu parihitas trir ahna upaspṛśaṃs tathā rātrau sthānāsanābhyāṃ pavitraṃ ta ity uttareṇāhorātrāṇi japan grāmadvāre sthānāsanabhojanāni yatra labhet tatra va", "translation": null}], "existence_evidence_type": "BRAHMANA"}
